  {
    "name": "setfillstyle",
    "cat": "图形颜色及样式设置相关函数",
    "sig": [
      "void setfillstyle(const FILLSTYLE* pstyle);",
      "void setfillstyle(int style, long hatch = 0, IMAGE* ppattern = NULL);"
    ],
    "brief": "设置当前设备填充样式。",
    "params": [
      [
        "pstyle",
        "指向 <a href='FILLSTYLE.htm'>FILLSTYLE</a> 的指针。"
      ],
      [
        "style",
        "填充样式：BS_SOLID、BS_NULL、BS_HATCHED、BS_PATTERN。"
      ],
      [
        "hatch",
        "阴影样式（BS_HATCHED 时有效）。"
      ],
      [
        "ppattern",
        "图案图像（BS_PATTERN 时有效）。"
      ]
    ],
    "ret": "无",
    "remarks": [
      "也可直接传入一个 COLORREF 作为快捷写法设置填充色.",
      "BS_HATCHED 支持 6 种标准阴影：HS_HORIZONTAL、HS_VERTICAL、HS_FDIAGONAL、HS_BDIAGONAL、HS_CROSS、HS_DIAGCROSS.",
      "<h3 style='margin:14px 0 4px;color:#10307a;'>BS_HATCHED 的 6 种阴影样式</h3>",
      "阴影图案是 8x8 逻辑单位平铺，线条取 <a href='setfillcolor.htm'>setfillcolor</a>，空隙透明（透出底下内容）。<br>",
      "<div style='margin:6px 0;'><b>HS_HORIZONTAL</b> —— 横向平行线<br><img src='data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhgAAVAIAAAP///wAAACwAAAAAgAAVAAACTISPqcvtD6OctNqLsz6h+w+G4kiW5omm6ri17gvH8kzX9o3n+s73/g8MCofEzOqITCqXx6LzCY1Kp9Sq9YrNardcBvMLDotZ3bI5WwAAOw==' alt='HS_HORIZONTAL' style='display:block;margin:3px 0;border:1px solid #c8d0dc;'></div>",
      "<div style='margin:6px 0;'><b>HS_VERTICAL</b> —— 纵向平行线<br><img src='data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhgAAVAIAAAP///wAAACwAAAAAgAAVAAACo4RjeZrI4FhUsz1463oa8wx+ohSSI1Wip7Vu5qvCrOzG9nzX+K73Hv3LBXlDX+eYIiJbxeYS+BRGlUlj1XmdWplaLDcL/oqhYfJYWkafqeut+a2Gs+XuuH1+r+P3+r6X/pcXyDfo13WYRojYVti4CPgoGKmYaFjpeDlpyaiJyZkJ+ikKGUo6KlmKekq5umn6qgrLKusaazt7W4u7q9vrSftrWwAAOw==' alt='HS_VERTICAL' style='display:block;margin:3px 0;border:1px solid #c8d0dc;'></div>",
      "<div style='margin:6px 0;'><b>HS_FDIAGONAL</b> —— 反斜线（左上到右下）<br><img src='data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhgAAVAIAAAP///wAAACwAAAAAgAAVAAACqYQfp6nG/VZzE0RUL53a5s+B4QiJEnmWKLZu6psu3WyysB3jupvzu9fyCYG3IS14LBJ7y1+naaxFkVKoNcnEZqvaqbJ75YrHX/KWii6n1exz22mGr910+dtbx9vv4bn+38c3A0YYB1joFyhoqLjneMjYCJmIuEhZIZlZmafJCNZ5GWo5ygRK+mjKuanq2SrKGpSKujp5akQrWwtra5Xriwvs+jorvGusUwAAOw==' alt='HS_FDIAGONAL' style='display:block;margin:3px 0;border:1px solid #c8d0dc;'></div>",
      "<div style='margin:6px 0;'><b>HS_BDIAGONAL</b> —— 正斜线（左下到右上）<br><img src='data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhgAAVAIAAAP///wAAACwAAAAAgAAVAAACqIQdp6nY/liT6wF6MJxW3w5G4siRlZmF5XqyKbq1rxvPso3X+gfztH/TeYaqIDB33BF7y5+maYQipcri1Fp1YpNcanfrDW/BZGZZa06jo2e22r2Gy7Px69tep8+/dz1+z5cX+EfoZzhYiGgo1qfoyChIBQk4mVh5+NRmqYnJ+WjhefnZKHpZGopKmkq5yqr6SnMK6xrZ2jm7iXsba7tL+5sL7BssPEpTAAA7' alt='HS_BDIAGONAL' style='display:block;margin:3px 0;border:1px solid #c8d0dc;'></div>",
      "<div style='margin:6px 0;'><b>HS_CROSS</b> —— 横纵交叉网格<br><img src='data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhgAAVAIAAAP///wAAACwAAAAAgAAVAAACsYRjeZrI4FhUsz1463oa8wx+ohSSI1Wip7Vu5qvCrOzG9nzX+K73Hv3LBXlDX+eYIiJbxeYS+BRGlUlj1XmdWplaLDcL/oqhYfJYWkY3Auy2+w2Py+f0uv2Oz8epZ775rwboF0g4aLgliFioeOiV6LgI2dhFmTZpyZgpqVnZx4m5Gdr5OBpZeukpCnr6eaL3ChsrO/uKSrqKm8qqqpt72wv8K2zqSxxsPGyLvKzc3DpcAAA7' alt='HS_CROSS' style='display:block;margin:3px 0;border:1px solid #c8d0dc;'></div>",
      "<div style='margin:6px 0;'><b>HS_DIAGCROSS</b> —— 双向斜线交叉网格<br><img src='data:image/gif;base64,' alt='HS_DIAGCROSS' style='display:block;margin:3px 0;border:1px solid #c8d0dc;'></div>",
      "注意：填充样式是<b>全局</b>的，用完<a href='阴影填充.htm'>阴影填充</a>后请调用 setfillstyle(BS_SOLID) 切回，否则连文字背景都会带上网纹。"
    ]
  },
