  {
    "name": "setlinestyle",
    "cat": "图形颜色及样式设置相关函数",
    "sig": [
      "void setlinestyle(const LINESTYLE* pstyle);",
      "void setlinestyle(int style, int thickness = 1,",
      "                  const DWORD* puserstyle = NULL, DWORD userstylecount = 0);"
    ],
    "brief": "设置当前设备画线样式。",
    "params": [
      [
        "pstyle",
        "指向 <a href='LINESTYLE.htm'>LINESTYLE</a> 的指针。"
      ],
      [
        "style",
        "画线样式，见备注。"
      ],
      [
        "thickness",
        "线宽，单位像素。"
      ],
      [
        "puserstyle",
        "自定义样式数组，仅 PS_USERSTYLE 有效。"
      ],
      [
        "userstylecount",
        "自定义数组元素数量。"
      ]
    ],
    "ret": "无",
    "remarks": [
      "<table class='t' style='width:80%' align='center'><thead><tr><th>值</th><th>含义</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class='head'><td>PS_SOLID</td><td>实线。</td></tr><tr><td>PS_DASH</td><td>虚线 ------------</td></tr><tr><td>PS_DOT</td><td>点线 ············</td></tr><tr><td>PS_DASHDOT</td><td>点划线 -·-·-·-·</td></tr><tr><td>PS_DASHDOTDOT</td><td>双点划线 -··-··</td></tr><tr><td>PS_NULL</td><td>不可见。</td></tr><tr><td>PS_USERSTYLE</td><td>自定义，由 puserstyle 与 userstylecount 指定。</td></tr></tbody></table>",
      "注意：本库<b>不支持</b>端点样式（PS_ENDCAP_*）与连接样式（PS_JOIN_*），style 中只有直线样式部分生效。",
      "粗线用 setlinestyle(PS_SOLID, n) 绘制时每段各自成四边形，折返重叠处半透明会叠色；需要整体带状描边请用 <a href='strokepolyline.htm'>strokepolyline</a> 系列。",
      "自定义样式数组最多使用 16 个元素；元素个数为奇数时会自动重复一遍以保证虚实交替。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "name": "setpolyfillmode",
    "cat": "图形颜色及样式设置相关函数",
    "sig": [
      "void setpolyfillmode(int mode);"
    ],
    "brief": "设置多边形填充模式。",
    "params": [
      [
        "mode",
        "ALTERNATE（默认）或 WINDING。"
      ]
    ],
    "ret": "无",
    "remarks": [
      "ALTERNATE 按奇偶规则填充，WINDING 按环绕数规则填充，两者对自相交多边形的填充结果不同。",
      "影响 <a href='solidpolygon.htm'>solidpolygon</a>、<a href='fillpolygon.htm'>fillpolygon</a>、<a href='fillpie.htm'>fillpie</a> 等多边形类填充，以及多环版本 <a href='solidpolygonmulti.htm'>solidpolygonmulti</a> / <a href='fillpolygonmulti.htm'>fillpolygonmulti</a>（含 <code>f</code> 版）。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "name": "setrop2",
    "cat": "图形颜色及样式设置相关函数",
    "sig": [
      "void setrop2(int rop);"
    ],
    "brief": "设置<a href='二元光栅操作.htm'>二元光栅操作</a>模式。",
    "params": [
      [
        "rop",
        "ROP2 码，如 R2_COPYPEN、R2_XORPEN、R2_NOT 等，共 16 种。"
      ]
    ],
    "ret": "无",
    "remarks": [
      "默认 R2_COPYPEN，此时 <b>alpha 才生效</b>；其他模式下 alpha 按 0.5 阈值测试，低于 128 的像素被直接丢弃而不是淡出。",
      "本库修正了 EasyX 中 R2_MASKPENNOT / R2_MERGEPENNOT 互换的错误，行为与 GDI 一致。"
    ]
  },
