      "需要窗口句柄时请优先用本函数，它始终有效。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "name": "InputBox",
    "cat": "窗口与系统",
    "sig": [
      "/* 显式 A 版（宏，等价于 inputboxA） */",
      "bool InputBoxA(char* pString, int nMaxCount,",
      "               const char* pPrompt = NULL, const char* pTitle = NULL,",
      "               const char* pDefault = NULL, int width = 0, int height = 0,",
